    Bug 1932267 - Add EWSisfy config to account hub, showing add on text for exchange in found config. r=aleca

    This patch shows the exchange option in the found config step with the option to install the config. This patch doesn't include installing the add-on.

    **How To Test**
    - Open Account Hub and enter testaccounts@o365.thunderbird.net as the email. You can skip the Auth modal step.
    - There should be a fourth option for exchange.
    - It should show "Requires Add-on"
    - Clicking it should show additional information about installing the add-on

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D229560

